<title>EGYPT: Egypt's Unirab 95/96 profit up.</title>
<headline>Egypt's Unirab 95/96 profit up.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's United Arab Spinning and Weaving/Unirab profit available for distribution rose to 32.56 million pounds in the financial year 1995/96, up from 28.76 million the previous year, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The years end on June 30.</p>
<p>The statement published on Saturday said the shareholders portion was 24.18 million in 1995/96, with a dividend of about 4.24 pounds per share. The previous year it was 17.19 million.</p>
<p>The annual general meeting decided on December 7 to increase the capital to 11.40 million pounds from reserves. Shareholders' equity was 166 million, the statement said.</p>
<p>+ Cairo newsroom 20 2 578-3290/1</p>
</text>
